# macOS tools required by the tracked shell, editor, and automation configs.
# This is intentionally a curated baseline: command-line tools plus the few
# GUI apps whose configuration is tracked in this repository. General-purpose
# apps (browsers, chat, office, ...) are not listed on purpose.

tap "laishulu/homebrew"
tap "abue-ammar/tinycast"

